    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15868279a1d46adb4ed4b6a5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『皐月賞』の本番が迫る。主役の座を\r\n手にせんと、テイエムオペラオーは\nメイショウドトウと共に研鑽を重ね――",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bbd998836610789a2949e3b7f868b2689c15cbe8de6c3e381a02142e55b19b5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
