      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:719cc6550c1d405ac8d9b065",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "そんなライバルたちの\r\n燃え盛る気持ちに触れて――",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7238b00e50d2ff1b4b3dff5aebda995c32131d1ac9c23dde280d49b30d8c198",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cfee2e54060ce526ad1c3f2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0c3cde1401962469823d93b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "アドマイヤベガの中でも\r\n少しずつ、何かが芽生え始めていた。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d0a9033daa12a793410024d7bed8f0ea2aacbdbf589f3f0debcf66bb9fea02c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd2b9045b3776536ddb7615b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "逆袭的南河三",
      "source_fingerprint": "736d814b9fca32d02c75ee75e6b35233c9162f5d91a28fed4be5cba96f7201d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2916bdd7b4519d4d9f223736",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "トレーナーの制止も聞かずアドマイヤベガは\r\nひたすら自分を追い込むように駆けて行く。\nそのうち、左脚に激痛が走り出す……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a562f9f5787a2e4c431d9995cb992b6ef13ef95aaf0a218a1fda3c422d9b0343",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e44152a41c659362a3d7128b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『菊花賞』前に見続けた悪夢によれば、\r\nそのまま脚が壊れるはずだった。\n償えるのなら、それでもいいと思っていた。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9393b2d4078d80dbb560cd3a37479b182aec182fc2c2ec2cdc91c24d6974628",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6c81fc03600a88046a29581",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "だが、他でもない――アドマイヤベガの前に\r\nようやく姿を現した妹自身が、償うことなど\n最初からなかったのだと語る。",
      "source_fingerprint": "35104f45d6d87c17f13fd9e54f7c3d0dc52d8a90e7c695cd9e363d29bfddb315",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b37b291528dbc093ba992c17",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『一緒にレースを楽しめたことが幸せだった』\r\nそう笑顔で語った妹は、訪れるはずだった\n悲劇の運命を抱え、それと共に消えていった。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e00c68dddc5e58b4143a6e60c0a91cae4390afa15d03cbb6f8161e5a46d8426a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c447e4dc93c0138360ee38be",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "トレーナーの必死の呼びかけにより、\r\nアドマイヤベガはようやく目を覚ます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52ab87af027aa12958005fda5c5baf0909226cfbe174880584d4d711fd69a90b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9177c06693528dbfa6cab4f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "だが彼女は、半身が欠けてしまった\r\n空虚のあまり、ただトレーナーに縋りついて\n涙を溢れさせるのだった。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2aa40a8911029485f45a1e4d90cca420d028b4df6263218e333249edeaa68147",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:609daec174224fd4131cd9c6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "命运的双子座",
      "source_fingerprint": "5aa3cc7c4b37b2de468e67a1123d053dd5329ab13062b6272cca6f0775e29a29",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033403.json",
      "json_path": [
