    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d53218998350a1b28c54ce8d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "妹を失い、抜け殻のようになってしまった\r\nアドマイヤベガの前に大笑を響かせながら\n現れたのは、テイエムオペラオーだった。",
      "source_fingerprint": "914da558080dd881f1b020872ae1830e8a25425c199254a0e6914b8b1838e4ae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:905fe6db78432a2e6432c8c9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4f5f0fab57aa98081711f3e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有無を言わさずといった体で、\r\n保護者として巻き込まれたトレーナー含め\n連れられた先は――",
      "source_fingerprint": "b004bbb60632d5cdfc5d4077642ec25c1dec9ea2f124080268f8d96735be1afb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dba52ddb542ec838d9855f20",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e77f3dc35c39559b2aa96762",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真夜中の海。困惑し立ち去ろうとする\r\nアドマイヤベガを鋭く咎め、\nテイエムオペラオーは夜明けを待てと言う。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c1c8abdf0c881909ac48e526ac944e82c8325e452951cf761133ea32751cec5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2828b7aeddaa35cb78c28aa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033404.json",
      "json_path": [
